        <mxCell id="15" value="Contracts: instance state is independent; application data is shared. Input uses the presented revision; stale clicks are rejected.&lt;br&gt;Any dispatched action invalidates all instances. Definitions and component payloads remain on the worker; native resources remain on the GUI thread." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#888888;fontSize=14;spacing=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
